  (text "RUT241 runs from the general 24 V rail. No 9 V converter.\nETH0 of the RevPi goes to the router LAN port. ETH1 is service.\nModbus slaves: 1 ATV320, 2 S200. Baud and parity are TODO.\nR1, 120 ohm, is drawn at the S200 end. Move it if the bus order changes.\nThe rotation drive is not on this bus." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 10.16 12.70 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "c768da9c-e808-54ef-93ed-04ec437ce0cc"))
